  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Co-ordinating, facilitating &amp; tracking progress towards Sustainable Energy for All by 2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Co-ordinating, facilitating &amp; tracking progress towards Sustainable Energy for All by 2030 is a component of Sustainable Energy for Women and Girls (SEWG) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;4,750,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Energy policy and administrative management, Electric power transmission and distribution (centralised grids), Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Energy conservation and demand-side efficiency.</narrative>
  </description>
